00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:49.949
This way, we won't be

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.051
led astray by others.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.485
For example, if we want to film some

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.553
