00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:27.921
So today, as a channel

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.889
to unlock everyone's industrial knowledge and

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:31.024
imagination,

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:32.926
we're going to teach you how

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.894
to easily and smoothly... If you

