00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:47.934
What kind of people are they short of?

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.669
They're short of junior sailors, short of captains.

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.504
You could be there every day looking after someone's boat,

00:02:51.504 --> 00:02:53.206
