00:03:04.918 --> 00:03:05.985
(just kidding). You can even gamble,

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:07.820
and look at the ocean today—

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:10.957
it's perfectly calm,

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:11.991
just

00:03:11.991 --> 00:03:13.826
like my phone. (

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.161
Insert product placement here.

