This is my laptop today.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.165
Don't worry about the brand.

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:20.200
Let me tell you, did you notice the crease when you opened it? Of course, you'll see one or two very small angles with the naked eye, and you might see a slight crease. Come on,

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.701
let

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:23.403
's

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:24.771
use

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:27.073
our

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:28.274
industrial

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:31.678
knowledge

00:03:31.678 --> 00:03:33.513
and imagination!

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.181
You know, the hinge in the middle

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.449
is printed using

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:37.150
a technology

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.218
called

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:38.985
micron-level,

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:39.886
micron-level liquid

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:41.087
, micron-level liquid 3D printed hinge.

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:42.655
Actually, Taiwanese people call it

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:43.456
photopolymerization

00:03:43.456 --> 00:03:44.123
—it's that simple.

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:45.525
See, Taiwanese people are so simple and straightforward.

00:03:45.525 --> 00:03:47.060
Photopolymerization involves UV curing

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.729
, but now 3D printing technology

00:03:49.729 --> 00:03:51.965
can use composite materials. Because

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:53.499
the structure inside

00:03:53.499 --> 00:03:55.902
a 3D printed hinge isn't CNC machined

00:03:55.902 --> 00:03:57.237
, it can be refined to the micron level

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.438
, the concept of um.

00:03:58.438 --> 00:03:59.672
I just happened to notice

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:01.107
that when you open it, the water ripples

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:02.542
are just as flat

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:03.977
as the sea surface .

00:04:03.977 --> 00:04:04.777
What do you mean, "flat

00:04:04.777 --> 00:04:05.979
as flat"?

00:04:05.979 --> 00:04:06.879
What are Taiwanese people talking about

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:08.114
? And because many of our channel viewers

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:09.616
are in the hardware processing industry

00:04:09.616 --> 00:04:10.617
, doing a lot of

00:04:10.617 --> 00:04:12.151
