00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:12.952
I... I was wondering

00:04:12.952 --> 00:04:13.453
why it was so flat,

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:15.421
and then I started to study its internal structure.

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:16.589
Wow, it's printed

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:17.724
! The reason

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:18.658
it uses printing is because it

00:04:18.658 --> 00:04:20.760
can directly fill in the uneven areas

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.829
between the screen and the hinge.

00:04:22.829 --> 00:04:24.197
So you see, when you pull it up,

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:25.732
the surface flatness is

00:04:25.732 --> 00:04:27.066
more than 75% better

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:29.235
than anything you've ever seen before.

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:29.636
Anyway

00:04:29.636 --> 00:04:31.771
, this is just to add a strange piece of industrial knowledge for everyone.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:34.007
