00:12:56.142 --> 00:12:57.376
Before taking the driving test,

00:12:57.376 --> 00:12:58.711
understanding the ocean is very important

00:12:58.711 --> 00:13:00.246
, so let's learn about tides first.

00:13:00.246 --> 00:13:01.347
When you go to driving school,

00:13:01.347 --> 00:13:04.116
you must understand some natural phenomena of navigation.

00:13:04.116 --> 00:13:06.318
Tides are very important.

00:13:06.318 --> 00:13:09.155
Why do tides occur?

00:13:09.155 --> 00:13:11.423
Several elements influence tides.

00:13:11.423 --> 00:13:13.092
The first is the moon's gravity.

00:13:13.092 --> 00:13:14.426
That's why you often hear

00:13:14.426 --> 00:13:17.096
fishermen say there are high tides on the first and fifteenth of the lunar month

00:13:17.096 --> 00:13:18.697
—because the moon is closer to us...

00:13:18.697 --> 00:13:20.466
Of course, the sun's gravity

00:13:20.466 --> 00:13:21.967
also affects us. How far away

00:13:21.967 --> 00:13:22.835
is the sun from us?

00:13:22.835 --> 00:13:24.570
It takes light eight minutes to travel that distance.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.137
Now imagine

00:13:25.137 --> 00:13:26.305
if the moon and the sun were on the same side... Do you think the sun

00:13:26.305 --> 00:13:27.973
or

00:13:27.973 --> 00:13:30.009
the moon

00:13:30.509 --> 00:13:32.011
 

00:13:32.011 --> 00:13:34.446
is more attractive ? Listen

00:13:34.446 --> 00:13:36.615
carefully. Why do ocean currents occur?

00:13:36.615 --> 00:13:38.651
Because

00:13:38.651 --> 00:13:39.718
when the moon

00:13:39.718 --> 00:13:40.553
is being pulled in from one side, it moves to another. When

00:13:40.553 --> 00:13:42.087
it

00:13:42.087 --> 00:13:44.089
moves to another place, the height of the water that is being pulled up will also move with it. So

00:13:44.089 --> 00:13:45.424
the water will flow. It's very

00:13:45.424 --> 00:13:46.559
simple. I'll tell you about

00:13:46.559 --> 00:13:47.059
this. At this point, we

00:13:47.059 --> 00:13:48.127
need to talk about something called

00:13:48.127 --> 00:13:48.994
Coriolis force. If today we...

00:13:48.994 --> 00:13:49.795
Look at this super flat.

00:13:49.795 --> 00:13:51.897
I can even spin it on it without feeling the gap in

00:13:51.897 --> 00:13:53.265
the middle. You can take notes

00:13:53.265 --> 00:13:56.635
in class and play with this at the same time. Look how flat it is. This is how you

00:13:56.635 --> 00:13:57.636
use this phone.

00:13:57.636 --> 00:13:59.572
Oh , right, only this one can

00:13:59.572 --> 00:14:00.706
