00:14:00.706 --> 00:14:02.408
like this. Teacher, aren't you going to continue?

00:14:02.408 --> 00:14:04.376
This is more fun. Subject lectures are important, but practical operation is even more important.

00:14:04.376 --> 00:14:04.977
Have you gone to sea

00:14:04.977 --> 00:14:07.079
? Have you gone

00:14:07.713 --> 00:14:08.747
