00:14:46.819 --> 00:14:48.354
teach

00:14:48.354 --> 00:14:49.488
us

00:14:49.488 --> 00:14:51.557
, so he said,

00:14:57.563 --> 00:14:59.632
" That motorboat thing

00:14:59.632 --> 00:15:00.833
you

00:15:00.833 --> 00:15:02.334
just

00:15:02.334 --> 00:15:05.037
talked about

00:15:05.037 --> 00:15:06.372
was

00:15:06.372 --> 00:15:08.407
too easy.

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:09.909
Sailing is much harder. You don't

00:15:09.909 --> 00:15:10.576
know how

00:15:10.576 --> 00:15:12.878
? After learning, nothing is

00:15:12.878 --> 00:15:13.946
